# .xrl-ignore — files/dirs EXCLUDED from repo-principia.md (XRL scan)
# Aligned with the Linux-era live architecture (2026-10-06):
# scan COVERS the live stack (multigate, foveated-memory, theme, XR_Vessel,
# Copilot, Mouth, run_xrlf, server_config) and skips Windows-era artifacts,
# archives, heavy binaries and third-party trees.

